WEBVTT

00:00.570 --> 00:04.630
And as for you...

00:05.420 --> 00:08.200
You're going to fight me!

00:08.200 --> 00:09.100
What?

00:09.100 --> 00:12.390
I'm afraid I don't understand.

00:12.390 --> 00:17.660
You didn't participate in this 
event with a fairy at your side.

00:17.950 --> 00:22.080
So I can't just give you a reward.

00:22.820 --> 00:24.320
Of course.

00:24.860 --> 00:28.600
So I'd like you to go through 
the process of fighting me,

00:28.600 --> 00:30.800
regardless of whether you win or not.

00:30.800 --> 00:34.790
As a reward, I'll give you some of my power.

00:34.790 --> 00:40.040
Of course, if you win, you'll get more.

00:40.040 --> 00:41.600
Is that all right?

00:41.600 --> 00:42.960
Got it!

00:42.980 --> 00:45.810
Fairy-playah

00:49.540 --> 00:51.660
The event's reached its climax.

00:52.460 --> 00:54.520
Now... let's see what happens.

00:59.910 --> 01:08.170
<b>A Playthrough of a Certain DUDE's
VRMMO LIFE</b>

02:25.490 --> 02:29.500
<b>Episode 5</b>

02:25.490 --> 02:29.500
<b>Earth Has a Big Battle With the Queen</b>

02:42.680 --> 02:45.640
<i>Now, how do I win this?</i>

02:47.500 --> 02:49.900
<i>It might not even be possible.</i>

02:50.260 --> 02:53.180
<i>The Fairy Queen has a lot of powerful magic.</i>

02:53.180 --> 02:59.290
<i>That High Explosion spell she used on 
Glad, especially. That thing's nasty.</i>

02:53.190 --> 02:54.360
<b>High Explosion</b>

03:01.380 --> 03:05.600
<i>The only advantage I have is that 
I've seen her fight once already,</i>

03:05.600 --> 03:10.830
<i>but I doubt she's ever fought an archer.</i>

03:11.400 --> 03:15.840
<i>I can't believe picking underpowered 
skills came in handy like this...</i>

03:16.280 --> 03:19.030
<i>But if the fight drags out, 
she'll learn to adapt,</i>

03:19.030 --> 03:20.830
<i>and that advantage will disappear.</i>

03:21.620 --> 03:24.930
<i>Which means I can't win by fighting fair,</i>

03:24.930 --> 03:28.860
<i>and the only way to beat 
her is to play dirty!</i>

03:28.860 --> 03:30.680
Are you ready?

03:32.090 --> 03:33.170
Yeah.

03:34.450 --> 03:36.300
I'm ready whenever!

03:37.060 --> 03:39.540
Let us begin, then.

03:54.000 --> 03:56.000
Sliding Charge!

03:56.000 --> 03:58.920
<b>Sliding Charge</b>

04:01.800 --> 04:05.030
<i>First, I'll use 70% of my 
strength and feel her out!</i>

04:06.530 --> 04:08.270
Wind Cutter!

04:10.610 --> 04:13.640
<i>That was strong enough 
to cancel Wind Cutter!</i>

04:13.640 --> 04:15.480
<i>Which means, at full strength...</i>

04:16.520 --> 04:18.080
Fire Lance!

04:17.440 --> 04:19.400
<b>Fire Lance</b>

04:35.280 --> 04:38.100
He countered my magic...

04:38.100 --> 04:40.680
I guess I'm at a disadvantage at this range.

04:40.680 --> 04:41.350
I'll have to...

04:41.750 --> 04:43.150
Wind Booster!

04:42.880 --> 04:44.760
<b>Wind Booster</b>

04:46.090 --> 04:48.270
<i>I knew that was coming!</i>

04:48.270 --> 04:49.390
A potion?

04:49.390 --> 04:50.650
I won't let you drink it!

04:50.650 --> 04:51.560
Shock!

04:51.220 --> 04:53.140
<b>Shock</b>

04:54.190 --> 04:57.910
I saw that coming, too! 
You used it in the fight with Glad!

05:00.580 --> 05:02.650
Is this... poison?

05:02.570 --> 05:07.030
<b>"Death Potion" A deadly poison potion made from suffocation herb.</b>

05:03.330 --> 05:07.030
Yup! I made it from suffocation herbs!

05:09.640 --> 05:13.780
You can't cast your spells 
in that poison fog, can you?

05:22.400 --> 05:26.700
I should've banned the use of items.

05:26.700 --> 05:28.800
Humans are weak creatures.

05:29.260 --> 05:31.900
And that's why we have to think

05:32.640 --> 05:35.450
about how we can defeat the strong.

05:35.450 --> 05:36.850
Earth Wall.

05:38.150 --> 05:40.770
<b>Earth Wall</b>

05:41.170 --> 05:45.420
Oh, my. He can't attack when 
she's protected like that.

05:45.420 --> 05:48.320
What will Earth do?

05:50.070 --> 05:51.660
Sneak?

05:51.660 --> 05:53.150
I get it!

05:53.150 --> 05:55.990
We can see him, but the queen can't!

05:56.300 --> 05:58.470
That's why he can use it!

05:58.930 --> 06:01.170
He's going to try to end the fight!

06:03.700 --> 06:06.080
He's not attacking?

06:07.950 --> 06:09.770
I can't even sense him.

06:10.980 --> 06:13.940
Is he waiting for the wall's 
duration to run out?

06:14.230 --> 06:18.470
Maybe I should go on the offensive, then?

06:21.520 --> 06:22.430
Where is he?

06:22.430 --> 06:24.540
You're wide open, Queen!

06:26.780 --> 06:28.450
<i>Time to end this!</i>

06:28.450 --> 06:30.220
<i>First, I'll throw her off balance!</i>

06:31.830 --> 06:33.620
Sliding Charge!

06:33.530 --> 06:35.450
<b>Sliding Charge</b>

06:36.950 --> 06:38.540
<i>And then attack with all I've got!</i>

06:38.540 --> 06:40.270
Gatling Arrow!

06:40.620 --> 06:43.460
<b>Gatling Arrow</b>

06:50.870 --> 06:52.600
Mirror Arrow!

06:51.430 --> 06:52.600
<b>Mirror Arrow</b>

06:59.280 --> 07:01.440
Twin-Fanged Arrow!

06:59.520 --> 07:01.020
<b>Twin-Fanged Arrow</b>

07:04.720 --> 07:06.260
<i>And this is the end!</i>

07:07.820 --> 07:10.100
Ad Caelum! Fly!

07:09.070 --> 07:10.740
<b>Fly</b>

07:11.260 --> 07:13.720
Arrow Twister!

07:17.380 --> 07:19.390
Secare Ventus!

07:19.390 --> 07:21.520
Wind Booster!

07:20.080 --> 07:22.000
<b>Wind Booster</b>

07:27.500 --> 07:29.670
This can't be...

07:45.060 --> 07:49.040
Oh, no! I forgot I was in 
front of all these people!

07:49.040 --> 07:50.650
Okay, time to beat feet.

07:50.650 --> 07:51.510
You...

08:03.000 --> 08:04.480
You've defeated me utterly!

08:04.480 --> 08:07.630
I realize now how overconfident I was!

08:09.050 --> 08:11.950
I'll treat today as a learning experience.

08:13.370 --> 08:16.630
And now it's time for your reward.

08:17.020 --> 08:20.970
Show me your broken fairy contract crystal

08:20.970 --> 08:24.220
and the stand for the 
Ring of the Fairy King.

08:26.080 --> 08:29.280
The stand for the Ring of the Fairy King?

08:29.280 --> 08:30.990
Oh, do you mean...

08:34.030 --> 08:35.620
This?

08:37.000 --> 08:38.540
Give them to me.

08:40.940 --> 08:43.160
Five, already...

08:43.580 --> 08:45.880
You truly are full of surprises!

08:46.380 --> 08:48.660
Come, children of light!

08:55.200 --> 08:58.270
Now there are six lights within.

08:58.270 --> 09:00.850
And this is a gift from me.

09:01.650 --> 09:03.720
And it's done.

09:09.530 --> 09:12.810
This ring shall be your reward.

09:13.340 --> 09:14.630
Hold it.

09:14.630 --> 09:15.990
What are you doing?

09:15.990 --> 09:17.240
What am I doing?

09:17.240 --> 09:20.910
Why are you trying to put that 
on my left ring finger?

09:20.910 --> 09:24.320
What's wrong with that? 
It's not going to cost you anything!

09:24.320 --> 09:30.250
It'll cost me a lot of things! 
Especially my sanity!

09:30.250 --> 09:31.730
It will, huh?

09:31.730 --> 09:35.310
Well, you're putting it on anyway!

09:36.470 --> 09:39.130
No!

09:39.530 --> 09:41.120
Fire Arm!

09:40.720 --> 09:43.140
<b>Fire Arm</b>

09:43.600 --> 09:44.980
<b>Combine</b>

09:43.600 --> 09:44.980
<b>Combine</b>

09:43.830 --> 09:46.210
A buff spell? No fair!

09:46.800 --> 09:48.970
All's fair in love and war!

09:48.970 --> 09:52.630
This is neither!

09:54.840 --> 09:56.550
Take good care of it, please.

09:57.200 --> 09:58.640
I can't get it off!

09:58.640 --> 09:59.620
Why?

10:00.110 --> 10:03.820
"The 87th Fairy Queen Ring."

10:03.790 --> 10:09.750
<b>The 87th Fairy Queen Ring
 Contains the power of the 87th Fairy Queen
and six elemental fairies. Only one exists in
the entire world. Wearing it allows one
passage to the Fairy Kingdom. The inside of
the ring says "Never Forget Me" in a language
that cannot be read.
 Type: Magical Ring (Cursed, Unique)
 Cannot be unequipped.</b>

10:04.080 --> 10:06.960
Contains the power of six elemental fairies...

10:06.960 --> 10:09.350
Only one exists in the entire world...

10:09.750 --> 10:12.670
<b>Cannot be unequipped.</b>

10:10.180 --> 10:12.670
Cannot be unequipped?!

10:13.420 --> 10:16.310
I'll be going back to my kingdom now.

10:16.310 --> 10:18.630
I hope we all meet again someday, everyone!

10:20.800 --> 10:23.780
That was a pretty fun event, huh?

10:23.780 --> 10:24.830
Sure was!

10:24.830 --> 10:27.520
I didn't expect the husband-and-wife 
comedy routine at the end!

10:27.830 --> 10:32.700
<i>And with that, One More Free 
Life Online's first major event,</i>

10:32.700 --> 10:35.710
<i>"The Fairy Ball," came to an end.</i>

10:38.670 --> 10:42.320
<i>Things were a little different 
after the event ended.</i>

10:43.100 --> 10:47.390
<i>My battle with the queen was uploaded 
to the game's official site,</i>

10:47.730 --> 10:50.290
<i>and people started to realize how strong the 
combination of wind magic and archery was.</i>

10:50.290 --> 10:53.670
<i>More and more players began to 
choose them for their build.</i>

10:53.940 --> 10:57.270
<i>I ended up famous as a result,</i>

10:57.270 --> 11:01.830
<i>and decided to head somewhere remote 
so I could play in peace and quiet.</i>

11:01.830 --> 11:03.140
<i>But...</i>

11:05.860 --> 11:07.840
Queen?! Why?

11:07.840 --> 11:11.720
That ring's actually a teleport point!

11:14.060 --> 11:18.780
<b>Te-Heh</b>

11:14.070 --> 11:18.770
I'm here to bring some love 
to a lonely, fairyless man!

11:18.770 --> 11:20.680
Just kidding!

11:21.080 --> 11:22.180
Is this...

11:22.180 --> 11:23.860
Is this who you normally are?

11:24.600 --> 11:27.150
That's so mean! I'm a queen!

11:27.150 --> 11:29.660
Then go back home and rule your kingdom!

11:29.660 --> 11:32.670
No! Ruling a kingdom is really boring!

11:32.670 --> 11:36.600
Let me relax for a bit! Please!

11:36.600 --> 11:41.710
<i>Looks like I'm not getting 
my peaceful game life back.</i>

11:43.760 --> 11:45.290
Look at that!

11:45.290 --> 11:47.370
It's the Fairy Queen's husband!

11:47.370 --> 11:49.450
Look at those killer shoes!

11:49.790 --> 11:51.810
<i>Th-This is awkward...</i>

11:51.810 --> 11:53.480
Hey, you there!

11:53.480 --> 11:54.410
I want to talk to you.

11:54.410 --> 11:55.740
Look at me!

11:55.740 --> 11:58.710
<i>Wow, somebody's trying to be intimidating.</i>

11:58.710 --> 12:01.480
<i>I feel bad for whoever they're talking to.</i>

12:01.480 --> 12:03.630
Hey! Look at me!

12:04.070 --> 12:06.390
<i>Yeah, of course they're 
just gonna get ignored.</i>

12:04.790 --> 12:06.230
Are you listening?!

12:06.230 --> 12:10.010
Hey! Hey! You there! Hey!

12:10.010 --> 12:11.930
<i>It's hard to relax here in town.</i>

12:11.930 --> 12:13.390
<i>Maybe I'll go hunting.</i>

12:13.390 --> 12:15.440
<i>There's something I want to try...</i>

12:21.050 --> 12:25.560
Hey, what kind of spell is Prism Nova?

12:25.560 --> 12:29.600
It just says it's something you 
can learn with the ring equipped.

12:29.600 --> 12:32.880
You'll have to try it and find out!

12:32.880 --> 12:35.870
That's your thing, right, honey?

12:37.840 --> 12:42.020
Fairies everywhere, hear my voice!

12:42.020 --> 12:44.360
Grant my wish!

12:44.700 --> 12:47.050
My prayers lie with the fairies!

12:47.050 --> 12:49.110
With my great wish!

12:49.460 --> 12:52.200
I make my wish unto the 
great ruler of the fairies.

12:52.200 --> 12:53.840
I make my wish to their ruler.

12:53.840 --> 12:57.810
I offer up a portion of my magic 
to the great ruler of the fairies,

12:57.810 --> 12:59.680
that she might empower my soul.

13:00.250 --> 13:03.550
Grant me your great 
protection this one time.

13:03.550 --> 13:05.420
Let that protection, and my magic,

13:05.700 --> 13:10.800
become a strength that brings pain and 
despair unto the enemy before me.

13:06.350 --> 13:11.400
<i>An Area of Effect targeting circle? 
I'll put it on the bear, and...</i>

13:11.850 --> 13:15.930
May this incantation be my vow, and may 
I be granted the aid of the fairy queen,

13:15.930 --> 13:20.310
that the glory and honor of this 
victory be offered up unto her!

13:21.060 --> 13:22.750
My name is Earth!

13:22.750 --> 13:27.100
He who was granted this skill 
by the 87th Fairy Queen!

13:28.010 --> 13:33.740
By the contract we swore, may a 
single miracle manifest before me.

13:34.060 --> 13:38.740
My wish becomes a spell, 
a plea unto the fairy queen.

13:38.740 --> 13:41.180
Grant my wish!

13:41.180 --> 13:44.210
Annihilate my foe with true power!

13:44.210 --> 13:46.110
Prism Nova!

13:46.220 --> 13:49.140
<b>Prism Nova</b>

14:06.250 --> 14:07.320
What the heck?!

14:12.680 --> 14:16.870
<i>I tried it a few more times after that, 
and figured out what it did, more or less.</i>

14:16.870 --> 14:18.370
<i>Prism Nova...</i>

14:19.400 --> 14:22.390
is a spell that afflicts all 
enemies in the area of effect

14:22.390 --> 14:24.770
with multiple random status effects?

14:24.770 --> 14:26.460
That's right!

14:26.460 --> 14:30.110
By the way, there's a lot of status 
effects it can inflict on someone,

14:30.110 --> 14:32.900
but paralysis and petrify have 
pretty low odds of triggering.

14:32.900 --> 14:36.670
Also, the cooldown period is 
pretty long, so be careful.

14:41.250 --> 14:43.620
Don't eat the food for the customers!

14:43.620 --> 14:45.660
I can at least have one, right?

14:45.660 --> 14:51.070
All the food in the Fairy Kingdom 
is so sweet! I need something else!

14:52.990 --> 14:55.810
And we rulers don't get any real freedom!

14:52.990 --> 15:02.380
<b>Ruler</b>

14:52.990 --> 15:02.380
<b>Retainers</b>

14:52.990 --> 15:02.380
<b>Citizens</b>

14:55.810 --> 14:57.680
We're the most important 
people in the country,

14:57.680 --> 15:00.040
which means we have to work harder 
for it than anybody else!

15:00.040 --> 15:02.310
We're the biggest slaves in the country!

15:03.760 --> 15:09.810
The ruler isn't on top! They have to 
support the whole country on their own!

15:03.960 --> 15:12.430
<b>Ruler</b>

15:03.960 --> 15:12.430
<b>Retainers</b>

15:03.960 --> 15:12.430
<b>Citizens</b>

15:09.810 --> 15:12.420
It's really hard!

15:12.420 --> 15:15.270
You're under a lot of stress, huh?

15:15.520 --> 15:17.440
Hey, you!

15:18.490 --> 15:21.100
How dare you ignore me back there!

15:23.170 --> 15:25.120
Hey, you there!

15:25.120 --> 15:26.030
I want to talk to you.

15:26.030 --> 15:27.390
Look at me!

15:27.390 --> 15:29.540
Oh, I remember.

15:29.540 --> 15:32.580
You were talking to me?

15:32.580 --> 15:34.190
Well, enough about that.

15:34.190 --> 15:38.120
I'm Nazer, with the guild "The Bow of Apollo."

15:38.120 --> 15:42.190
We're working towards our great goal:

15:42.190 --> 15:45.540
the salvation of oppressed 
archers everywhere.

15:45.540 --> 15:48.100
<i>What's with this guy?</i>

15:48.460 --> 15:52.390
And that's why I want to help a poor,
 suffering soul like you,

15:52.390 --> 15:56.100
who cries himself to sleep at night 
because no guild will have him!

15:56.100 --> 15:57.520
I've come offering you salvation!

15:58.220 --> 16:01.500
We'll prepare for you a position 
at the lowest rank of our guild,

16:01.500 --> 16:04.100
so come with me, and be grateful!

16:05.940 --> 16:07.430
Thanks, but I'm good.

16:07.430 --> 16:08.380
Bye.

16:20.630 --> 16:21.840
Isn't it time you headed home?

16:21.840 --> 16:22.220
No.

16:23.490 --> 16:27.000
Fine. You can take some of the 
food for the customers with you.

16:27.000 --> 16:28.670
Really?

16:30.790 --> 16:32.900
This should be enough, right?

16:33.540 --> 16:34.640
Yup!

16:34.640 --> 16:36.530
Now I feel ready to get back to work.

16:36.530 --> 16:39.980
You really are a big eater.

16:41.550 --> 16:42.710
You're so silly.

16:42.710 --> 16:44.490
That's not what I meant.

16:46.610 --> 16:48.520
Anyway, see you later!

16:49.680 --> 16:51.520
I don't know what that meant,

16:51.520 --> 16:54.230
but I should be able to get 
some peace and quiet now.

16:54.660 --> 16:58.130
Tomorrow, I'll work on 
my equipment some more.

17:00.590 --> 17:02.160
Hello!

17:02.160 --> 17:04.450
Now, then...

17:04.450 --> 17:06.030
What are you all doing there?

17:06.030 --> 17:08.420
Sorry, sorry.

17:06.030 --> 17:10.350
<i>Stare...</i>

17:08.420 --> 17:11.480
You're famous right now.

17:11.480 --> 17:13.470
You too, Blacks?

17:13.880 --> 17:17.260
You can watch, but don't stand so close.

17:17.260 --> 17:18.540
Okay!

17:21.470 --> 17:25.140
<i>First, I'll upgrade the 
X-type compound hunting bow.</i>

17:25.140 --> 17:29.760
<i>I've used it a whole bunch, 
so I need to swap out the bow itself.</i>

17:29.760 --> 17:32.310
<i>And while I'm at it, I've decided 
to change the materials I use.</i>

17:32.840 --> 17:36.230
<i>The wood will be something 
newer and higher quality.</i>

17:36.680 --> 17:41.790
<i>The reinforcements will be 
light metal instead of iron.</i>

17:42.200 --> 17:47.880
<b>X-type Compound Hunting Bow (Upgraded)
Effect: Atk+46 Score: 7</b>

17:42.590 --> 17:47.310
<i>The result was a big upgrade 
to a more powerful bow!</i>

17:50.010 --> 17:53.280
<i>The next step is to 
upgrade my bladed shoes.</i>

17:53.280 --> 17:57.000
<i>I'll be making changes to them, too,
 including the materials I use!</i>

17:57.000 --> 17:58.530
<i>First, the shoes.</i>

17:59.120 --> 18:01.270
<i>Last time I used iron.</i>

18:01.270 --> 18:05.080
<i>But this time I'll use mostly light 
metal to increase its armor value</i>

18:05.080 --> 18:07.640
<i>and stability when landing.</i>

18:08.190 --> 18:10.560
<i>I'll make the spikes out of steel.</i>

18:10.560 --> 18:14.080
<i>I'll add in the screw twists that I learned 
to make when doing my arrowheads,</i>

18:14.080 --> 18:16.490
<i>so that they're more powerful when attacking.</i>

18:18.780 --> 18:21.330
<i>And last but not least, the blades.</i>

18:21.330 --> 18:23.750
<i>Last time, I put them on the sides.</i>

18:24.290 --> 18:28.010
<i>This time I'll put them on the front, 
and make it so you can swap them!</i>

18:28.410 --> 18:31.010
<i>It'll make them easier to repair,</i>

18:31.690 --> 18:34.000
<i>and if I kick with my toes,
 I can deal damage with the blade,</i>

18:34.820 --> 18:37.180
<i>and if I kick with the soles 
of my feet, the spikes!</i>

18:37.180 --> 18:40.060
<i>They'll be sure to deal additional damage.</i>

18:44.140 --> 18:48.770
<b>Fang Leg Blade
 Effect: Atk+29 Def+10
 Score: 6</b>

18:44.290 --> 18:45.420
<i>They're done!</i>

18:55.900 --> 19:01.810
<i>I'd honestly feel better if they still 
just looked at me like I was a weirdo.</i>

19:02.270 --> 19:04.830
<i>Now then, there's one thing left to do.</i>

19:08.250 --> 19:10.500
This is great!

19:10.870 --> 19:13.630
<b>Bearskin Cape
Effect: Def+15
Score: 9</b>

19:11.280 --> 19:13.470
Wait, it's got a score of 9?

19:13.470 --> 19:15.460
You brought me the materials,

19:15.460 --> 19:18.300
so just like I promised, 
it's yours for 5,000 gloh.

19:18.300 --> 19:20.980
You're really letting me have it that cheap?

19:20.980 --> 19:22.730
Don't worry about it.

19:22.730 --> 19:24.740
I always charge the amount I said I would,

19:24.740 --> 19:27.220
no matter what the score ends up being.

19:27.220 --> 19:28.510
I see.

19:28.510 --> 19:29.680
Thank you.

19:30.970 --> 19:32.200
A message?

19:32.200 --> 19:33.790
Who sent it?

19:34.360 --> 19:39.020
Ayame... the guildmaster of the Bow of Apollo?

19:44.590 --> 19:47.180
<i>Are they all members of the Bow of Apollo?</i>

19:47.180 --> 19:48.890
<i>It's a big guild.</i>

19:48.890 --> 19:50.900
Welcome, Earth.

19:51.830 --> 19:55.440
I am Ayame, guildmaster of the Bow of Apollo.

19:56.760 --> 19:58.280
Hello...

19:58.280 --> 20:00.630
What can I do for you today?

20:00.900 --> 20:04.960
I wanted to apologize for 
Nazer's behavior the other day.

20:10.820 --> 20:13.950
After your battle with the Fairy Queen,

20:13.950 --> 20:16.510
every player in One More knows about you.

20:16.510 --> 20:17.500
Huh...

20:18.290 --> 20:20.420
As an archer-only guild,

20:20.420 --> 20:24.030
if we can get you to join us, 
we'll be able to grow even bigger.

20:24.810 --> 20:27.360
At least, that's what he seemed to think...

20:27.360 --> 20:31.400
Don't worry. It didn't 
offend me or anything.

20:31.400 --> 20:34.010
No, that's not all.

20:34.540 --> 20:36.570
We did an investigation

20:36.570 --> 20:41.460
and found that Nazer's been using 
your name to recruit members.

20:42.820 --> 20:45.150
I want to apologize to you on his behalf.

20:45.150 --> 20:47.920
I'm so sorry, Earth!

20:47.920 --> 20:50.220
Um...

20:50.220 --> 20:51.460
Got it!

20:51.460 --> 20:54.430
I accept your apology for that, too.

20:54.430 --> 20:55.890
Please raise your head.

20:56.590 --> 20:58.530
Thank you.

20:58.530 --> 21:02.710
We've punished him to ensure 
this never happens again.

21:02.710 --> 21:04.130
Punished him?

21:04.780 --> 21:08.350
He's been demoted from
 lieutenant to ordinary member.

21:08.350 --> 21:10.730
He's also lost his guild invite privileges.

21:10.730 --> 21:12.070
We won't banish him.

21:12.070 --> 21:14.200
He must accept his punishment 
as a member of our guild.

21:15.020 --> 21:18.150
That is my responsibility as leader.

21:19.210 --> 21:20.590
That's fine.

21:20.590 --> 21:22.470
I think that's a good way to handle it,

21:22.810 --> 21:24.650
and I have no objections.

21:25.960 --> 21:28.540
One more thing, Earth.

21:29.490 --> 21:33.720
Your battle with the 
Fairy Queen was truly amazing!

21:33.720 --> 21:36.380
You're the hope of archers everywhere.

21:36.770 --> 21:39.490
Keep it up!

21:39.490 --> 21:40.810
We all have great expectations for you!

21:43.690 --> 21:48.100
<i>That battle's had all kinds of 
effects on the game, huh?</i>

21:48.790 --> 21:53.060
<i>I just want to relax and enjoy the game...</i>

21:56.870 --> 21:59.760
He defeated EA and won its friendship,

21:59.760 --> 22:04.550
and he's having a massive influence 
on other players, as well.

22:04.550 --> 22:07.510
He's a player we'll have to keep an eye on.

22:07.510 --> 22:09.970
<b>To Be Continued</b>
